WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:06.214
I have to draw whenever I see
something beautiful.

00:00:06.214 --> 00:00:08.216
What? Well...

00:00:09.884 --> 00:00:12.929
Annihilation of an entire race

00:00:13.054 --> 00:00:15.015
shouldn't be the price of peace.

00:00:15.265 --> 00:00:17.642
Killing you was the point.

00:00:17.890 --> 00:00:20.560
What the hell did you just say?

00:00:23.064 --> 00:00:26.609
Hello. How are you? I'm Pepe Vilchis.

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:30.405
I'm a voice actor.
I'm Mexican, and I live in Mexico City.

00:00:32.574 --> 00:00:33.658
Oh, boy.

00:00:33.742 --> 00:00:36.911
This might turn into something incredible.

00:00:36.995 --> 00:00:38.663
I started dubbing

00:00:38.747 --> 00:00:42.417
just around the year of 1989.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:47.589
The Godmother, as we call her,
Gloria Rocha, gave me my first shot.

00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:52.594
She is the director of this TV show
you all know, called DRAGON BALL.

00:00:52.677 --> 00:00:57.724
Later came another show.
You know it, too, KNIGHTS OF THE ZODIAC.

00:00:57.807 --> 00:01:01.436
And that's how my career
as a voice actor began.

00:01:04.105 --> 00:01:05.523
My family.

00:01:06.483 --> 00:01:10.862
I am Trevor Belmont
of the House of Belmont.

00:01:11.863 --> 00:01:15.617
And dying has never frightened me.

00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:20.747
That's a great question.
What do the fans mean to me?

00:01:20.830 --> 00:01:26.211
A huge commitment, really.
I appreciate them so much.

00:01:26.294 --> 00:01:31.633
And for them to acknowledge my work
means everything to me.

00:01:31.716 --> 00:01:37.639
So it becomes a huge commitment
to always give them my best effort,

00:01:37.722 --> 00:01:42.227
all my affection,
and the work you're all used to.

00:01:42.310 --> 00:01:48.483
So, what could I say? Thank you so much,
sincerely, for appreciating my work,

00:01:48.566 --> 00:01:52.904
and all I can promise is my work,

00:01:52.987 --> 00:01:56.324
to give my best, as always, for you all.

00:01:56.407 --> 00:02:00.662
They can't even fight
their violent impulses. How foolish.

00:02:03.331 --> 00:02:06.709
I must confess, I'm…

00:02:06.835 --> 00:02:11.422
a huge videogames fan,
so one of my favorite shows

00:02:11.506 --> 00:02:13.675
on Netflix

00:02:13.716 --> 00:02:19.347
is THE WITCHER. It is excellent.
The characters are amazing.

00:02:19.389 --> 00:02:25.186
It's a show I watch often.
Also, I was born in 1977, picture that…

00:02:25.228 --> 00:02:30.567
The '80s and '90s where a hit for me,
because I grew up then,

00:02:30.692 --> 00:02:32.569
and the COBRA KAI show…

00:02:32.694 --> 00:02:37.407
I am so hooked, so please…

00:02:37.532 --> 00:02:41.244
Please, don't take too long
with the new season.

00:02:42.078 --> 00:02:43.288
Thank you.

00:02:45.957 --> 00:02:47.250
Thank you.

00:02:47.917 --> 00:02:50.003
I finished delivering my share.

00:02:50.086 --> 00:02:52.630
Why don't you come over and have dinner?

00:02:52.714 --> 00:02:59.304
Thank you so much for following the work
of Pepe Vilchis, that is, me.

00:02:59.387 --> 00:03:05.268
It's wonderful. It's amazing, really,
to be here for all of you.

00:03:05.393 --> 00:03:09.397
Thank you. Thank you so much.
If you'd like to follow my social media,

00:03:09.439 --> 00:03:14.027
it's P, as in Pepe, another P, as in Pepe,
Vilchis, MX.

00:03:14.110 --> 00:03:17.739
You'll find me on Instagram, on Facebook,

00:03:17.822 --> 00:03:21.993
on Twitter, or even on my YouTube channel.

00:03:22.076 --> 00:03:26.581
Thank you. Thank you so much.
I hope you're well, and…

00:03:26.623 --> 00:03:31.586
Something I always say that
has helped me is, "Believe in love".

00:03:31.628 --> 00:03:33.796
And never give up on your dreams.

